OL,3,GNEWSAFormer transport minister used
OL,4,Aphone while driving
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former transport minister says he
OL,7,F"deeply regrets" using a mobile phone
OL,8,Fwhile driving after he was fined and
OL,9,Fawarded six penalty points on his
OL,10,Flicence.
OL,12,FGeorge Freeman, the Conservative MP for
OL,13,FMid Norfolk, pleaded guilty to the
OL,14,Foffence at Stratford Magistrates' Court
OL,15,Fin London on 1 September.
OL,17,FHe was fined #430 and told to pay a
OL,18,Fsurcharge of #172 to support justice
OL,19,Fservices, as well as #130 in costs to
OL,20,Fthe Metropolitan Police.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
